We'll simulate an OTP Expiration System.

Scenario

Suppose a banking application generates OTPs.

OTP	Valid For
OTP-101	5 seconds
OTP-102	10 seconds
OTP-103	7 seconds

The system should:

Generate OTPs (Producer Threads)
Store them inside DelayQueue
Automatically remove (expire) them after their validity period
Consumers should not continuously check (No Busy Waiting)

This is exactly what DelayQueue is designed for.